       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "$ java -jar fcrepo-webapp/target/fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console.jar --headless",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Likely as a result of the following commit, this functionality is no longer supported:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It is now required for the user to provide a \"-Dfcrepo.modeshape.configuration=...\" configuration.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to re-enable the default \"classpath:/config/file-simple/repository.json\" configuration for the one-click-run.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
