  "description": "<p>The following functionality used to be supported:<br/>\n$ mvn clean install -pl fcrepo-webapp -Pone-click<br/>\n$ java -jar fcrepo-webapp/target/fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console.jar --headless</p>\n\n<p>Likely as a result of the following commit, this functionality is no longer supported:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c</a><br/>\n(<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393</a>)</p>\n\n<p>It is now required for the user to provide a \"-Dfcrepo.modeshape.configuration=...\" configuration.</p>\n\n<p>This task is to re-enable the default \"classpath:/config/file-simple/repository.json\" configuration for the one-click-run.</p>",
